  _glyph: "\U0001F9B9\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Tyrant of the Winkies
  _description: Has only one eye, but it is as powerful as a telescope. She enslaves
    the Winkies and commands the [[f9c948b9-4026-48fc-a17b-697a3d2864d6|King of the
    Winged Monkeys]] with the [[a2be94e7-27ba-428e-ad51-fe4d358d3d40|Golden Cap]].
    Water is the only thing she fears.
